WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary digest v1.0 — planetary-digest (sw) · microsoft-edge-neural

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:12.031
<v Narrator>Karibu kwenye OpenIE Utafiti Radio Planetary Digest, kuelezea kwa kifupi 29 wazi-kupata utafiti juu ya kuthibitishwa, nishati-kuhesabu computing.

2
00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:30.720
<v Narrator>Katikati yetu 4-awamu ya kutafuta-wa kwanza cascade, haraka daima wakati hash meza, trigram utafutaji viwango, na hasa integer solvers kushughulikia maswali ya kawaida ndani, kuamka kubwa mifumo ya neva tu kama njia ya mwisho.

3
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:57.099
<v Narrator>Katika mstari wa 5-volt bodi shunts na 0.09 hadi asilimia 0.11 ya idle drift, unpacking 0.1517 bits kwa uzito matrices nyuma kwa 32-bit floats kupoteza 81.86 mara zaidi bodi nishati kuliko integers 8-bit, wakati packed integer mantiki kuanguka kwa 187.49 microjoules jumla na kukata kamili kaskazini nishati mara 26.58.

4
00:00:57.179 --> 00:01:13.390
<v Narrator>Kila utafiti una meli na hashes za cryptographic, determinism ya mtindo wa 6-fabric, kilobit 24 Opus feeds za bandwidth ndogo, maelezo ya sauti iliyopanuliwa, na muhtasari wa Creative Commons Zero.
